{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced action roguelite demo where you kite, dash, and chain spells to survive escalating waves\u2014this demo includes 1\u20132 levels and a curated skill set for deckbuilding with core synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can experience in this demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable scope:</strong> 1\u20132 room-based levels with several waves of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learnable Skills:</strong> Curated subset (&gt; 50 skills) of the full  library to showcase core synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Session length:</strong> Short, replayable runs focused on timing, positioning, and build experimentation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/8f8329a75971b70a9d4681fcf66e0a37.poster.avif?t=1758365465\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/8f8329a75971b70a9d4681fcf66e0a37.webm?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/8f8329a75971b70a9d4681fcf66e0a37.mp4?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit &amp; Run Combat</strong> \u2013 Fire rapid\u2011cast spells, dodge incoming attacks, and reposition yourself to control the fight flow. Players can leverage dash, fireball, or other skills to defeat waves of enemies in the room level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/96ecc20d73233c852ebb7535bbba431f.poster.avif?t=1758365465\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/96ecc20d73233c852ebb7535bbba431f.webm?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/96ecc20d73233c852ebb7535bbba431f.mp4?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage\u2011only Build System</strong> \u2013 Shape your mage through <strong>horizontal progression</strong>: no XP grinding! Choose from unique spells, enabling deep, customizable playstyles. We will provide a curated skill set (&gt; 50 skills) to let players try core synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/7160ca02de57a028368d60badf4ae141.poster.avif?t=1758365465\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/7160ca02de57a028368d60badf4ae141.webm?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/7160ca02de57a028368d60badf4ae141.mp4?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Skill Shrine</strong> \u2013 Players can <strong>invest Gold and Gems\u00a0</strong>into the shrine to enhance its quality and increase the odds of accessing higher-tier skills.\u00a0Spend resources reasonably to improve roll quality in the room level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player mode:</strong> Single-player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Input:</strong> Keyboard &amp; mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages (Demo)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English</strong> \u2014 Interface \u2714 | Subtitles \u2714 | Audio \u2716</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not in this demo (available in the full game):</strong> additional room levels, a broader skill library and rarities, more enemy/boss variety, and expanded build paths.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948870?t=1758365465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948870?t=1758365465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/94502d9996c6e84a87cba76b77b736d024f8f98c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758365465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/94502d9996c6e84a87cba76b77b736d024f8f98c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758365465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced action roguelite demo where you kite, dash, and chain spells to survive escalating waves\u2014this demo includes 1\u20132 levels and a curated skill set for deckbuilding with core synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can experience in this demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable scope:</strong> 1\u20132 room-based levels with several waves of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learnable Skills:</strong> Curated subset (&gt; 50 skills) of the full  library to showcase core synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Session length:</strong> Short, replayable runs focused on 