 synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/7160ca02de57a028368d60badf4ae141.poster.avif?t=1758365465\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/7160ca02de57a028368d60badf4ae141.webm?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/extras/7160ca02de57a028368d60badf4ae141.mp4?t=1758365465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Skill Shrine</strong> \u2013 Players can <strong>invest Gold and Gems\u00a0</strong>into the shrine to enhance its quality and increase the odds of accessing higher-tier skills.\u00a0Spend resources reasonably to improve roll quality in the room level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player mode:</strong> Single-player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Input:</strong> Keyboard &amp; mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages (Demo)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English</strong> \u2014 Interface \u2714 | Subtitles \u2714 | Audio \u2716</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not in this demo (available in the full game):</strong> additional room levels, a broader skill library and rarities, more enemy/boss variety, and expanded build paths.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Anaheim Works"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3820380","name":"Shadow Quest"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948870/de1ec504aa23c69a2f48e85c3f2527e5eade7670/header.jpg?t=1758365465","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul c